This crate contains translations of Basalt and separately attributed algorithms.
The per-file notices identify the applicable terms. Full license texts are in
LICENSE-BSD-3-Clause, LICENSE-MPL-2.0, and LICENSE-MIT; additional third-party
notices, including BSD-4-Clause code, are retained in the relevant source files.

Basalt code: Copyright (c) 2019 Vladyslav Usenko and Nikolaus Demmel.
See LICENSE-BSD-3-Clause. The upstream MPL files utils/tracks.rs and
utils/union_find.rs retain their original notices.
record_t265.rs additionally retains Michael Loipführer as a 2019 copyright
holder, as stated in the original recording executable.

Eigen algorithms translated under MPL-2.0 (see LICENSE-MPL-2.0):

* utils/complete_orthogonal_decomposition.rs: CompleteOrthogonalDecomposition,
  column-pivoted Householder QR and Householder operations.
  Copyright (C) 2016 Rasmus Munk Larsen; (C) 2010 Gael Guennebaud.
* utils/ldlt.rs: pivoted LDLT.
  Copyright (C) 2008-2011 Gael Guennebaud; (C) 2009 Keir Mierle;
  (C) 2009 Benoit Jacob; (C) 2011 Timothy E. Holy.
* utils/amd.rs: approximate minimum degree ordering.
  Copyright (C) 2010 Gael Guennebaud; derived from CSparse,
  Copyright (c) 2006 Timothy A. Davis, relicensed by permission in Eigen.
* utils/sparse_ldlt.rs: simplicial LDLT.
  Copyright (C) 2008-2012 Gael Guennebaud; derived from LDL,
  Copyright (c) 2005 Timothy A. Davis.
* time_alignment.rs: the JacobiSVD specialization used for quadratic fitting.
  Copyright (C) 2009-2010 Benoit Jacob; (C) 2013-2016 Gael Guennebaud.
* kitti_eval.rs: matrix-to-quaternion conversion.
  Copyright (C) 2008-2010 Gael Guennebaud; (C) 2009 Mathieu Gautier.
* vio_sim.rs: RandomImpl floating-point mantissa construction.
  Copyright (C) 2024 Charles Schlosser.

Other Eigen-derived helpers in utils/full_piv_householder_qr.rs,
vi_estimator/ba_base.rs and calibration/cam_imu_calib.rs retain their own
copyright notices. Files containing both Basalt and Eigen-derived code identify
both licenses; their Eigen-derived portions are not relicensed as BSD.
